# Build context is frontends/ (see docker-compose frontend-admin).
# Exclude host node_modules — pnpm workspace junctions break Docker on Windows
# ("invalid file request .../node_modules/@invsys/shared-types").
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.pnpm-store
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/tsconfig.*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
